  dialogueText: 'My counter is getting crowded!

    When you need to politely get
    someone''s attention or pass through a crowded space, you can say ''dispensaren
    nak.''

    It means ''excuse me.''

    Listen carefully: dispensaren nak.

    Now,
    try saying ''dispensaren nak'' yourself."

'
